npc_customer_1: Hey there! Can you scan these snacks and sodas for me? Tonight is movie marathon night!
player: Sure. What are you watching?
npc_customer_1: Just some old horror movies. But honestly, walking here was creepier.
npc_customer_1: I saw some people burning joss paper at the crossroads. It's the Ghost Month, after all. Be careful working alone!
player: Thanks, I'll keep that in mind.
